  "title": "EAP-AKA: Check for attribute length zero",
  "description": "In EAP-AKA, an attribute's length includes the Attribute Type and\nLength bytes. It is given in unit of 4 bytes, and cannot be zero.\nCheck for a value zero, and add an expert info and break the loop\nif so. The previous check became ineffectual after switching to\nunsigned variables.\n\nhttps://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc4187#section-8\n\nFixup b640e18410059d26b6c8af78b1851bc179ba5038\nFix #21007\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
